{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "about": "How each value in packages/aqua-ui/src/styles/tokens.json reaches the stylesheets. tokens.json documents the values. The two library stylesheets (aqua.css, now-playing.css) mirror them by hand. The `airwave` group runs the other way: airwave-window.css and airwave-hub.css are generated from the designs in design/frontends/origin (pnpm build:window-css), the design files own those values, and tokens.json records them so this check notices when a design changes one. The hub’s four contrast inks are in docker-container/src/web/styles.css (DEC-022). scripts/styleguide-check.mjs compares every token with the light-scheme :root value of its custom property. A token not listed here uses the default name (see defaults). `literal` entries have no custom property and are checked for presence in the named file only, which is weaker. `exception` entries are known differences, recorded rather than hidden; adding one needs a reason and a decision in design/decisions.md.",
  "stylesheets": [
    "packages/aqua-ui/src/styles/aqua.css",
    "packages/aqua-ui/src/styles/now-playing.css",
    "packages/aqua-ui/src/styles/airwave-window.css",
    "packages/aqua-ui/src/styles/airwave-hub.css",
    "docker-container/src/web/styles.css"
  ],
